// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// 📁 prisma/schema.prisma
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client"
  output   = "../src/generated/prisma"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// ENUMS
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

enum Direction {
  OUTBOUND
  INBOUND
}

enum PassengerType {
  REGULAR
  STUDENT
  SENIOR
  PWD
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// ADMIN (Supabase Auth link)
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

model Admin {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  email        String   @unique
  passwordHash String   // <-- Added this
  name         String?
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt

  @@map("admins")
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// GEOGRAPHY
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

model City {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  name      String   @unique
  region    String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  routes    Route[]
  terminals Terminal[]
  stops     Stop[]

  @@map("cities")
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// ROUTES
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

model Route {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  code        String   @unique
  name        String
  description String?
  cityId      String
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  city     City           @relation(fields: [cityId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  variants RouteVariant[]
  fares    Fare[]

  @@index([cityId])
  @@index([name])
  @@map("routes")
}

model RouteVariant {
  id        String    @id @default(cuid())
  routeId   String
  name      String
  direction Direction
  isDefault Boolean   @default(false)
  geometry  Json?
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime  @updatedAt

  route     Route           @relation(fields: [routeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  stops     RouteStop[]
  terminals RouteTerminal[]

  @@index([routeId])
  @@index([routeId, direction])
  @@map("route_variants")
}

model RouteStop {
  id         String  @id @default(cuid())
  variantId  String
  stopId     String
  sequence   Int
  isTerminal Boolean @default(false)

  variant RouteVariant @relation(fields: [variantId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  stop    Stop         @relation(fields: [stopId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([variantId, sequence])
  @@index([variantId])
  @@index([stopId])
  @@map("route_stops")
}

model RouteTerminal {
  id         String @id @default(cuid())
  variantId  String
  terminalId String

  variant  RouteVariant @relation(fields: [variantId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  terminal Terminal     @relation(fields: [terminalId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([variantId, terminalId])
  @@index([variantId])
  @@index([terminalId])
  @@map("route_terminals")
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// FARES (history + passenger types)
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

model Fare {
  id            String        @id @default(cuid())
  routeId       String
  passengerType PassengerType @default(REGULAR)
  amountMin     Decimal       @db.Decimal(8, 2)
  amountMax     Decimal       @db.Decimal(8, 2)
  source        String
  verifiedAt    DateTime?
  effectiveFrom DateTime      @default(now())
  effectiveTo   DateTime?
  createdAt     DateTime      @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime      @updatedAt

  route Route @relation(fields: [routeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([routeId, passengerType])
  @@index([routeId, effectiveFrom])
  @@map("fares")
}

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// STOPS & TERMINALS
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

model Terminal {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  cityId    String
  name      String
  area      String?
  address   String?
  latitude  Float
  longitude Float
  notes     String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  city     City            @relation(fields: [cityId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  variants RouteTerminal[]

  @@index([cityId])
  @@index([name])
  @@index([area])
  @@map("terminals")
}

model Stop {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  cityId    String
  name      String
  landmark  String?
  latitude  Float
  longitude Float
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  city     City        @relation(fields: [cityId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  variants RouteStop[]

  @@index([cityId])
  @@index([name])
  @@map("stops")
}